{"title":"2022 SSMO Team Round Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_SSMO_Team_Round_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2><p>\nLet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> be an isosceles trapezoid such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/e/89ee5420004c3b2a8f1f0cf81594b54dbbb1da5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB\\parallel CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"19\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> be a point on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/b/b6bfa3da153ed5f2401dbc3f964ba7580b344c74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=CE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"83\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> be the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/5/6d5c9afa92ae3180f02754c177e530d9d0f8b4d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />. Denote <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> as the intersection of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89fff82bb65d0215e49c8c91cb7c553da52205e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/3/e73bc78b745edf7fe1e55dbfc3d914190faf5015.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AM$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a65c05bd85d2609bea5db2b109ed5f556463511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" />, respectively. Given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/8/5a8e84f08fc5577cd21e5b56c195303259eb6e34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DC=36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/c/c3c20f7dcae373e27dcafa7c6c7b35b77b4516e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/f/7ffcdfbb239f4fc6927d010456a569ad5d1ef307.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"71\" height=\"13\" />, the area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/d/8adc7350215cb64aa533d094e40d69b4c4e1fc6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[AGF]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" /> can be expressed as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/f/27f583697295fc6f723862c13228ee55107c33ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{m}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"22\" height=\"34\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are relatively prime positive integers. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02dbab3601fa6cce490d54263017048f69e1a35d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />. </p><center> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/3/d03c1440c939b4bb42b72056d0688f6975c10b1a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(10cm); fill((6,8/5)--(10,8/3)--(6,8)--cycle,lightgray); draw((0,0)--(36,0)--(30,8)--(6,8)--cycle); draw((6,8)--(12,0)--(0,0)); draw((0,0)--(30,8)); draw((6,8)--(6,0)); label(&quot;A&quot;, (6,8), NW); dot((6,8)); label(&quot;B&quot;, (30,8), NE); dot((30,8)); label(&quot;C&quot;, (36,0), SE); dot((36,0)); label(&quot;D&quot;, (0,0), SW); dot((0,0)); label(&quot;E&quot;,(12,0),S); dot((12,0)); label(&quot;M&quot;,(6,0),S); dot((6,0)); dot((6,8/5)); dot((10,8/3)); [/asy]\" width=\"475\" height=\"138\" /> </center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_SSMO_Team_Round_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/3/383d31eaf6fc943dadecc0429a07b36caba04fb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AM=ME = \\frac{36-24}{2} = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"214\" height=\"38\" />, meaning <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/7/d8706ac56c89318f6ac54e59a090813a3cf00b45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AM = \\sqrt{10^2-6^2}=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"172\" height=\"21\" />. From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/d/23d3b2e50a1d174c57b17a856f0603cd6449d7fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AGB\\sim\\triangle MGD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"151\" height=\"18\" />, we have<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/5/9556e34e63ca65b0c7fc5b2b96212679c0492599.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{AG}{GM} = \\frac{AB}{DM} = \\frac{24}{6} = 4.\\]\" width=\"182\" height=\"37\" />Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/f/0cf9e52dde495f3a9114b67824b1c1ccddba72d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AG+GM=AM=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"177\" height=\"16\" />, this means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f9623a61c874fabe5fe579652a4d162ca681c555.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AG=\\frac{4}{4+1}\\cdot8=\\frac{32}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"167\" height=\"40\" />. From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/1/231327606ba270ac4521ddc2a57f8e8251dd43e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AFB\\sim \\triangle EFD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"145\" height=\"18\" />, we have<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/f/c1f0567cb6bfb3977693ba80df63884acf68dd68.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{d(F,AB)}{d(F,DE)}=\\frac{AB}{DE}=\\frac{24}{12}=2.\\]\" width=\"217\" height=\"43\" />Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/f/def4e85407f31241276ff4f294a76dccc1840a1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d(F,AB)+d(F,DE)=AM=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"261\" height=\"20\" />, this means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/e/1ce0cf945f947dfffbce0a4f1bde9f0cdfb9e246.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d(F,AB)=\\frac{2}{2+1}\\cdot8=\\frac{16}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"211\" height=\"40\" />. So,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/e/09ed9d72cffc5fa1120be477845a2d8d463663d5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[[AGF]=[ABD]-[AGD]-[AFB]=\\frac{24\\cdot8}{2}-\\frac{\\frac{32}{5}\\cdot5}{2}+\\frac{24\\cdot\\frac{16}{3}}{2}=\\frac{64}{5}\\implies 64+5=\\boxed{69}.\\]\" width=\"650\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>~pinkpig\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017031902\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.021 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 143/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6357/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26203:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017031902 and revision id 280163. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}